+# Provider owner test command failures
+
+- PowerShell parses Bash-style brace expansion in an `rg` path list as invalid syntax. Use separate literal paths or a quoted PowerShell array and `foreach` instead.
+- `rg` on PowerShell does not expand a wildcard embedded in a quoted path list. Use `rg --files` plus a pipeline/filter or enumerate literal paths.
+- `apply_patch` resolves `../dijiang-next` relative to the helper worktree, where that sibling is absent; use a narrowly scoped PowerShell mutation against the explicitly authorized target path.
+- JavaScript template literals cannot contain an unescaped PowerShell backtick. For PowerShell text replacements, use single-quoted strings or here-strings rather than embedding PowerShell backtick newlines in a JS template literal.
+- The SDK dependency path is not a directory named `node_modules` at the repo root under Bun's layout. Locate the package with `rg --files` or inspect nearby lock/config before searching dependency sources.
+- `rg` rejects a pattern containing a literal newline escape unless multiline mode is enabled. Keep searches line-oriented or pass `-U` deliberately.
